# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:65
translate kr numa_moreaboutpeople_4dff1363:

    # NUMA @ talk "Speak the wave, and I shall answer."
    NUMA @ talk "물결을 말하라, 그리하면 내가 답하리다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:68
translate kr numa_moreaboutpeople_menu_f26655da:

    # NUMA @ talk "Once a month, our people wash up on the docks bringing supplies and gifts."
    NUMA @ talk "한 달에 한 번, 우리 종족은 보급품과 선물을 가지고 부두로 밀려옵니다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:69
translate kr numa_moreaboutpeople_menu_0f7b9bbf:

    # NUMA @ talk "Treasure from sunken ships, pearls, some fish..."
    NUMA @ talk "침몰선의 보물, 진주, 생선 약간…"

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:70
translate kr numa_moreaboutpeople_menu_f222a1c7:

    # NUMA @ talk "In return, we are given weapons and armours forged."
    NUMA @ talk "그 대가로, 우리는 제련된 무기와 갑옷을 받습니다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:71
translate kr numa_moreaboutpeople_menu_b1ea096b:

    # MC @ think "Why would you need such things?"
    MC @ think "그런 게 왜 필요하지?"

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:72
translate kr numa_moreaboutpeople_menu_93d5f8b3:

    # NUMA @ serious "... The waves are a turbulent thing."
    NUMA @ serious "… 물결이란 격랑의 존재이니까요."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:73
translate kr numa_moreaboutpeople_menu_088c241e:

    # NUMA @ talk "They turn towards war."
    NUMA @ talk "그 물결이 전쟁으로 향하고 있습니다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:74
translate kr numa_moreaboutpeople_menu_416963ed:

    # MC @ think "War? What war?"
    MC @ think "전쟁? 무슨 전쟁?"

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:75
translate kr numa_moreaboutpeople_menu_7ed5d058:

    # NUMA @ talk "It matters not for you surface breathers."
    NUMA @ talk "지상의 숨쉬는 자들에게는 상관없는 일입니다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:76
translate kr numa_moreaboutpeople_menu_ad0fd71f:

    # NUMA @ talk "There are many fiefdoms vying for power below the currents."
    NUMA @ talk "해류 아래에는 권력을 다투는 수많은 봉토들이 존재합니다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:77
translate kr numa_moreaboutpeople_menu_35287cb9:

    # NUMA @ talk "The senate-"
    NUMA @ talk "원로원이—"

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:78
translate kr numa_moreaboutpeople_menu_e906b857:

    # "She stopped herself, her lips curling into a forced smile."
    "그녀는 말을 멈추고, 입술을 억지 미소로 말아 올렸다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:79
translate kr numa_moreaboutpeople_menu_24708383:

    # NUMA @ smile "Forgive me, your Thalvën is so good, I forgot myself for a moment."
    NUMA @ smile "용서하십시오, 당신의 탈벤이 너무나 훌륭하여 잠시 정신을 잃었습니다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:83
translate kr numa_moreaboutpeople_menu_f6a7145e:

    # NUMA @ talk "In order to maintain good relations with the merchants, a few of our Thalay kin were asked to work within the city."
    NUMA @ talk "상인들과의 우호 관계를 유지하기 위해, 우리 탈레이 동족 몇 명이 도시 내에서 일해 달라는 요청을 받았습니다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:84
translate kr numa_moreaboutpeople_menu_38f5e1d4:

    # NUMA @ talk "It is purely for diplomatic reasons, they even asked what role we would like."
    NUMA @ talk "순전히 외교적 이유에서이며, 어떤 역할을 원하는지까지 물어봐 주었습니다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:85
translate kr numa_moreaboutpeople_menu_dc0e7cd8:

    # NUMA @ smile "I asked to help run a library, so they had built this place to accomodate my needs."
    NUMA @ smile "제가 도서관 운영을 돕겠다고 요청했더니, 그분들이 제 필요에 맞춰 이곳을 지어 주셨습니다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:86
translate kr numa_moreaboutpeople_menu_b4acba9f:

    # MC @ think "They built a whole library for you?"
    MC @ think "널 위해 도서관 전체를 지었다고?"

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:87
translate kr numa_moreaboutpeople_menu_3fbd73b2:

    # NUMA @ talk "No, they built a whole library to keep my kin happy... I just happen to work within it."
    NUMA @ talk "아니요, 제 동족의 환심을 사기 위해 도서관 전체를 지은 것입니다… 저는 그저 그 안에서 일하게 된 것뿐입니다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:91
translate kr numa_moreaboutpeople_menu_32267830:

    # NUMA @ talk "Of course... It pleases me to be able to talk to one as clearly as you."
    NUMA @ talk "물론입니다… 당신처럼 또렷하게 대화할 수 있는 이가 있다는 것이 기쁩니다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:96
translate kr numa_whatareyou_711b6f6a:

    # "Numa's eyelids blinked twice as she tilted her head once more."
    "누마는 다시 한 번 고개를 기울이며 눈꺼풀을 두 번 깜빡였다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:97
translate kr numa_whatareyou_38893e4f:

    # NUMA @ talk "How can one speak the wave so well and not know what we are?"
    NUMA @ talk "어찌 이토록 물결을 능숙히 구사하면서도 우리가 무엇인지 모를 수 있습니까?"

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:98
translate kr numa_whatareyou_c79bb790:

    # MC @ think "It's... complicated."
    MC @ think "그게… 복잡해."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:99
translate kr numa_whatareyou_7c8b810c:

    # NUMA @ talk "... I see."
    NUMA @ talk "… 알겠습니다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:100
translate kr numa_whatareyou_53b96c9d:

    # NUMA @ talk "Then to answer your question, I am Thalay."
    NUMA @ talk "그럼 질문에 답하자면, 저는 탈레이입니다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:101
translate kr numa_whatareyou_09fc90be:

    # NUMA @ smile "I presume I may be one of the first, or perhaps THE first, of my kind you've seen since arriving in Hamun."
    NUMA @ smile "하문에 도착하신 이후로 보신 같은 종족 중, 제가 첫 번째이거나 아마 유일한 첫 번째일 거라 짐작합니다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:102
translate kr numa_whatareyou_ec863f7f:

    # MC @ talk "Yes."
    MC @ talk "응."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:103
translate kr numa_whatareyou_12452374:

    # NUMA @ talk "Mmm... It is not surprising."
    NUMA @ talk "으음… 놀랍지 않군요."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:104
translate kr numa_whatareyou_3fe64a20:

    # NUMA @ talk "Our people conduct only limited business with land breathers."
    NUMA @ talk "우리 종족은 육지의 숨쉬는 자들과 제한된 거래만을 합니다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:110
translate kr numa_talk_d20b5586:

    # NUMA @ smile "Greetings again, how may I help?"
    NUMA @ smile "다시 인사드립니다, 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:115
translate kr numa_bye_aaff2ad9:

    # NUMA @ smile "Come back anytime... It pleases me to have someone I can actually speak the wave with."
    NUMA @ smile "언제든 다시 오십시오… 실제로 물결을 나눌 수 있는 이가 있다는 것이 기쁩니다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:119
translate kr numa_books_trade_e8d2f9b6:

    # NUMA @ talk "Okay."
    NUMA @ talk "알겠습니다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:120
translate kr numa_books_trade_b1ba029d:

    # NUMA @ talk "Let's take a look then..."
    NUMA @ talk "그럼 살펴보도록 하지요…"

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:122
translate kr numa_books_trade_c787f2b4:

    # NUMA @ talk "Is there anything else?"
    NUMA @ talk "또 다른 일이 있으신가요?"

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:127
translate kr numa_firstmeet_2a75a3f6:

    # "Entering into the Hamun library was... an unusual sight."
    "하문 도서관에 들어선 광경은… 기이했다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:128
translate kr numa_firstmeet_8bc35701:

    # "While the usual rows of books were neatly stacked up high as one would expect, a deep, decorated pool lay in the center of the library,"
    "예상대로 책들이 반듯하게 높이 쌓여 있었지만, 도서관 중앙에는 깊고 장식된 연못이 자리하고 있었다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:129
translate kr numa_firstmeet_7c9fd79f:

    # "Complete with a strange water fountain statue of what appeared to be a mage striking up a bargain with a strange fish like humanoid."
    "그리고 마법사로 보이는 자가 물고기 같은 기이한 인간형과 거래를 트는 모습을 형상화한, 기묘한 분수상까지 갖추고 있었다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:130
translate kr numa_firstmeet_6d119730:

    # "Looking around, I could see no one in the library."
    "주위를 둘러보았지만, 도서관 안에는 아무도 보이지 않았다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:131
translate kr numa_firstmeet_27bb84f3:

    # MC @ think "Hello? Is anyone here?"
    MC @ think "계세요? 아무도 안 계세요?"

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:132
translate kr numa_firstmeet_730a3730:

    # "A shadow appeared along waters of the pool, and in a moment, the blue skinned humanoid like woman emerged."
    "연못 물결을 따라 그림자가 드리우더니, 이내 푸른 피부의 인간형 여성이 모습을 드러냈다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:135
translate kr numa_firstmeet_db1efe9f:

    # "Naked, and covered in scales as the water dripped from her body, the gilged creature turned it's gaze towards me."
    "벌거벗은 채 비늘로 뒤덮인 그 아가미 달린 생물은, 몸에서 물이 뚝뚝 떨어지는 가운데 시선을 내게로 돌렸다."

# game/data/characters/numa/dialogue.rpy:136
translate kr numa_firstmeet_fe773dc3:

    # UNKNOWN "Lora'shen... Vaalra korril'neth, sollan?"
    UNKNOWN "Lora'shen... Vaalra korril'neth, sollan?"

